    "theorem": "FinitePointEvaluationAudit.finite_point_evaluation_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem finite_point_evaluation_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (x y : K) (h : W.Equation x y), RingHom.ker (localPointEval W h) = IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal (PointLocalRing W x y h) ∧ (∀ a : PointLocalRing W x y h, pointResidueEquiv W h (IsLocalRing.residue (PointLocalRing W x y h) a) = localPointEval W h a) ∧ (∀ c : K, localPointEval W h (algebraMap W.CoordinateRing (PointLocalRing W x y h) (algebraMap K W.CoordinateRing c)) = c) ∧ ∀ a : PointLocalRing W x y h, IsUnit a ↔ localPointEval W h a ≠ 0) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (x y : K) (h : W.Nonsingular x y), Function.Bijective (localToFiniteRing W h) ∧ ∀ a : PointLocalRing W x y h.1, (finiteLocalEquiv W h a : W.FunctionField) = pointToField W h.1 a) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (P : W.Point), Function.Surjective (regularEvaluation W P) ∧ (∀ c : K, regularEvaluation W P (regularConstant W P c) = c) ∧ (∀ a : RegularRing W P, regularEvaluation W P a ≠ 0 ↔ localFunctionValuation W P a = 1) ∧ ∀ (f : W.FunctionField) (_ : f ≠ 0), pointOrder W f P = 0 ↔ localFunctionValuation W P f = 1) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (x y : K) (h : W.Nonsingular x y) (a b : W.CoordinateRing) (_ : pointEval W x y h.1 b ≠ 0), ∃ r : RegularRing W (.some x y h), (r : W.FunctionField) = algebraMap W.CoordinateRing W.FunctionField a / algebraMap W.CoordinateRing W.FunctionField b ∧ regularEvaluation W (.some x y h) r = pointEval W x y h.1 a / pointEval W x y h.1 b) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (f : W.FunctionFieldˣ) (D : W.Point →₀ ℤ), Disjoint D.support (functionDivisor W f f.ne_zero).support ↔ f ∈ supportUnits W D.support) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (D : W.Point →₀ ℤ) (f g : W.FunctionFieldˣ) (hf : Disjoint D.support (functionDivisor W f f.ne_zero).support) (hg : Disjoint D.support (functionDivisor W g g.ne_zero).support), evaluateDivisor W D (f * g) (disjoint_principal_mul W D f g hf hg) = evaluateDivisor W D f hf * evaluateDivisor W D g hg) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (T : Finset W.Point) (D E : W.Point →₀ ℤ), divisorEvaluationOn W T (D + E) = divisorEvaluationOn W T D * divisorEvaluationOn W T E) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (T : Finset W.Point) (D : W.Point →₀ ℤ) (_ : D.support ⊆ T) (c : Kˣ) (f : supportUnits W T), divisorEvaluationOn W T D (supportConstantUnits W T c * f) = c ^ divisorDegree W D * divisorEvaluationOn W T D f ∧ (divisorDegree W D = 0 → divisorEvaluationOn W T D (supportConstantUnits W T c * f) = divisorEvaluationOn W T D f)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [IsAlgClosed K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (_ : W.Δ ≠ 0) (D : W.Point →₀ ℤ) (_ : divisorDegree W D = 0) (f g : W.FunctionFieldˣ) (hf : Disjoint D.support (functionDivisor W f f.ne_zero).support) (hg : Disjoint D.support (functionDivisor W g g.ne_zero).support) (_ : functionDivisor W f f.ne_zero = functionDivisor W g g.ne_zero), evaluateDivisor W D f hf = evaluateDivisor W D g hg) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (x : K) (e : W.FunctionField →+* K) (_ : ∀ c : K, e (constantHom W c) = c) (_ : e (xFunction W) = x), False) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (x y : K) (h : W.Nonsingular x y), (¬ ∃ a : PointLocalRing W x y h.1, pointToField W h.1 a = (verticalFunction W x)⁻¹) ∧ 1 < finiteAdic W h (verticalFunction W x)⁻¹ ∧ finiteRegularEval W h (finiteLocalEquiv W h (localU W h.1)) = 0 ∧ SingletonAddFailure W h) ∧ rationalCurve.Δ ≠ 0 ∧ rationalCurve.Nonsingular (0 : F3) 1 ∧ pointOrder rationalCurve (verticalFunction rationalCurve 0) controlPoint = 1 ∧ pointOrder rationalCurve (verticalFunction rationalCurve 0) 0 = -2 ∧ controlDivisor.support ≠ controlPrincipalDivisor.support ∧ ¬ Disjoint controlDivisor.support controlPrincipalDivisor.support",
    "decl_sha256": "2cde7adfeb312bf57894458dffa98c17ef4ff2a0bbba2e8680f023d3f897f591",
    "scope": "Actual elliptic finite-point local residue evaluation and guarded function/divisor evaluation. For everyFieldK/actualW/actualpointEquation, actualcoordinatepointEval lifts toactualPointLocalRing→K, withconstants/surjectivity/kernelmax/residueField≃K/unitiffnonzerovalue. Foractualnonsingularfinitepoint, officialDVRintegerlift applied toprovedactualpointDVR/fullactualFunctionField yieldsactualbijectiveembedding/RingEquiv toofficialfiniteAdic valuation subring andexactfieldcoercion. Combineactualfiniteandcreditedinfinitylocalcomparisons toactualallpointRegularRing/residueRingHom; constants evaluateidentically; actualnonzeroresidueiffvaluation1 andactualnonzerofunctionpointOrder0iffvaluation1. Actualcoordinatefraction a/b withactualpointEval(b)neq0 hasactualregularrepresentative/valuepointEval(a)/pointEval(b), agreeingwithactualunitvalue. Officialvaluationunitgroupequivalence/Units.map giveactualpoint/supportunitmaps; actualprincipal-divisor supportdisjointiffactualunitatsupport derived, notsupplied. ActualK-unit-valued divisorproduct/functionmultiplicativity/divisoradd/constantfactor c^actualdegree anddegreezero scalarinvariance proved. Actualequalgeometricprincipaldivisors giveequaldivisorvalues underactualIsAlgClosedK/WΔneq0/Ddegree0/disjointguards: qualifiedellipticforwardcaseofGalbraithExercise26.1.1, notconverse/allcurves/reciprocity. Genericactualverticalnonzerofunction precludes anytotalcoefficientfixingFF→Khom mappingXtofinitepointx; itsinverse hasnoactuallocalrepresentative/officialfiniteadicvalue>1, whileactualregularverticalvalue0. Actualsingletondivisors±1cancel buttotalizedzerozpowproductfailsaddlaw. ActualpriorF3curve y²=x³+x+1/Δneq0/P=(0,1)NS/verticalorder1atP,−2atO: singletonsupportunequalyetoverlapsactualprincipal-support. Targetsdeletedunit/disjointguards/merelyunequalreading, notintendedsourcequalification.76modules67exactcredited+9new/defaults/standardfoundations. Fullscheme/localRing/DivisorAPIinterop/finitepointdivisorbasechange/tens